      "problem": "Elena writes $150$ words in $3$ minutes. If she writes at a steady pace, then what statement describes the unit rate?",
      "worked_solution": "The ratio of written words to minutes is $150:3.$ So we start with the ratio $150:3$ and write it as a fraction:\n\n$$\n\\frac{150}{3}\n$$\n\nWe can make a denominator of $1$ by dividing the numerator and denominator by $3$:\n\n$$\n\\frac{150÷3}{3÷3}=\\frac{50}{1}\n$$\n\nConsequently, Elena writes $50$ words per minute.",
